[36m(TaskRunner pid=607832)[0m code='\nfrom experiments.solution import solution\n\ndef coin_change(denominations, num_coins, target):\n    """\n    Calculate the number of distinct ways to make the target amount using the given denominations.\n    \n    Parameters:\n    denominations (list): A list of distinct coin denominations.\n    num_coins (int): The number of distinct coin denominations.\n    target (int): The target amount to achieve.\n    \n    Returns:\n    int: The number of distinct ways to make the target amount.\n    """\n    dp = [0] * (target + 1)\n    dp[0] = 1\n    for coin in denominations:\n        for amount in range(coin, target + 1):\n            dp[amount] += dp[amount - coin]\n    return dp[target]\n'
